---
import { DONORS, PARTNERS, waqafState, rupiah, persenID } from '../data/waqaf';
const w = waqafState;
---
  <section id="donatur" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">

      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <span class="section-label">Transparansi Donasi</span>
        <div class="divider-gold mx-auto mt-3 mb-4"></div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-navy-primary">Daftar Donatur Waqaf</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm md:text-base mt-4">
          Setiap rupiah yang masuk dicatat dan dibuka. Di bawah ini rincian pemasukan waqaf beserta nama para donatur yang telah menyalurkan amal jariyahnya.
        </p>
      </div>


      <!-- Mitra kelembagaan -->
      <div class="reveal max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <p class="text-center text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gray-500 mb-4">Dukungan Lembaga &amp; Mitra</p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {PARTNERS.map((p) => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-navy-primary/10 bg-white p-5">
              <img src={p.logo} alt={'Logo ' + p.name} class="partner-logo" loading="lazy" width="96" height="48" />
              <div>
                <strong class="block text-navy-primary text-sm">{p.name}</strong>
                <span class="block text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">{p.note}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ============================================================
           LEDGER — rincian pemasukan yang benar-benar berjumlah
           ============================================================ -->
      <div x-data="waqafLedger()" class="reveal max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-primary/10 bg-offwhite/60 overflow-hidden">

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-6 md:px-8 py-4 border-b border-navy-primary/10 bg-white">
            <h3 class="font-display text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-navy-primary">Rincian Pemasukan Waqaf</h3>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-primary/70">
              <i data-lucide="calendar-check-2" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              Per {w.updated}
            </span>
          </div>

          <dl class="px-6 md:px-8 py-2">
            <div class="ledger-row">
              <dt class="ledger-label"><span class="tnum" x-text="donors.length">{DONORS.length}</span>donatur tercatat</dt>
              <dd class="ledger-value tnum" x-text="rp(rollTotal)">{rupiah(w.rollTotal)}</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger-row">
              <dt class="ledger-label">
                Pemasukan belum dirinci
                <button type="button"
                        @click="showNote = !showNote"
                        :aria-expanded="showNote"
                        aria-controls="ledger-note"
                        class="ledger-info"
                        aria-label="Penjelasan pemasukan belum dirinci">
                  <i data-lucide="help-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </button>
              </dt>
              <dd class="ledger-value tnum" x-text="rp(unlisted)">{rupiah(w.unlisted)}</dd>
            </div>

            <div id="ledger-note" x-show="showNote" x-transition.opacity x-cloak
                 class="mb-3 -mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-600 bg-white rounded-xl border border-navy-primary/10 p-4">
              Pemasukan yang sudah diterima dan diverifikasi panitia, namun rinciannya belum dipublikasikan atas permintaan donatur. Bukti penerimaannya tetap tersimpan dan dapat diperiksa.
            </div>

            <div class="ledger-row ledger-row-sum">
              <dt class="ledger-label-sum">Total pemasukan waqaf</dt>
              <dd class="ledger-value-sum tnum" x-text="rp(totalWaqaf)">{rupiah(w.totalWaqaf)}</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger-row">
              <dt class="ledger-label">Modal awal pembangunan</dt>
              <dd class="ledger-value tnum" x-text="rp(modalAwal)">Rp 300.000.000</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger-row ledger-row-total">
              <dt class="ledger-label-total">Dana progres terkumpul</dt>
              <dd class="ledger-value-total tnum" x-text="rp(danaProgres)">{rupiah(w.danaProgres)}</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>

          <div class="px-6 md:px-8 pb-6 pt-2">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2 gap-3">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">Progres terhadap RAB</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-navy-primary tnum text-right">
                <span x-text="persenLabel">{persenID(w.persen)}</span>% <span class="font-normal text-gray-400">dari <span class="tnum" x-text="rp(totalRAB)">{rupiah(w.totalRAB)}</span></span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-2.5 rounded-full bg-navy-primary/10 overflow-hidden"
                 role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100"
                 :aria-valuenow="Math.round(persen)"
                 :aria-label="'Progres dana ' + persenLabel + ' persen dari total RAB'">
              <div class="ledger-bar" :style="'clip-path: inset(0 ' + (100 - persen).toFixed(1) + '% 0 0)'" style={`clip-path:inset(0 ${(100 - w.persen).toFixed(1)}% 0 0)`}></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ============================================================
           DONOR ROLL — satu sumber data, bisa dicari
           ============================================================ -->
      <div x-data="donorRoll()" class="reveal reveal-delay-1 max-w-3xl mx-auto">

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3 mb-5">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-navy-primary">
            Nama Donatur <span class="text-gray-400 font-body font-medium text-sm tnum">(<span x-text="donors.length">{DONORS.length}</span>)</span>
          </h3>

          <div class="relative sm:w-64">
            <label for="donor-search" class="sr-only">Cari nama donatur</label>
            <i data-lucide="search" class="pointer-events-none absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 text-gray-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <input id="donor-search" type="search" x-model="query" autocomplete="off"
                   placeholder="Cari nama donatur"
                   class="donor-search">
            <button type="button" x-show="query.length > 0" x-cloak @click="clearQuery()"
                    class="donor-search-clear"
                    aria-label="Hapus pencarian">
              <i data-lucide="x" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ol id="donor-roll-list" class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 border-t border-navy-primary/10">
          <template x-for="(d, i) in donors" :key="i">
            <li x-show="isVisible(d, i)" x-cloak class="donor-row">
              <span class="donor-no tnum" x-text="i + 1"></span>
              <span class="donor-name" x-text="d.n"></span>
              <span class="donor-amount tnum" x-text="rp(d.v)"></span>
            </li>
          </template>
        </ol>

        <!-- Empty state -->
        <div x-show="matchCount === 0" x-cloak class="py-12 text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-3 w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-navy-primary/5 grid place-items-center">
            <i data-lucide="search-x" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Tidak ada nama yang cocok dengan &ldquo;<span class="font-semibold text-navy-primary" x-text="query"></span>&rdquo;.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1.5">Donasi Anda belum tercatat? Hubungi panitia lewat konfirmasi transfer.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer: subtotal + disclosure -->
        <div class="border-t-2 border-navy-primary/15">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-4">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
              <span x-show="!query">Subtotal <span class="tnum" x-text="donors.length">{DONORS.length}</span>&nbsp;donatur</span>
              <span x-show="query" x-cloak><span class="tnum" x-text="matchCount"></span>&nbsp;nama cocok</span>
            </span>
            <span class="font-display font-bold text-navy-primary tnum" x-text="rp(visibleTotal)">{rupiah(w.rollTotal)}</span>
          </div>

          <div x-show="!query && donors.length > previewCount" x-cloak class="pb-1">
            <button type="button" @click="expanded = !expanded" :aria-expanded="expanded" aria-controls="donor-roll-list"
                    class="donor-toggle">
              <span x-text="expanded ? 'Tampilkan lebih sedikit' : 'Tampilkan semua ' + donors.length + ' donatur'">Tampilkan semua {DONORS.length} donatur</span>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-4 h-4 donor-toggle-icon" :class="expanded ? 'is-open' : ''" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Callout Note -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 mt-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-gold/5 rounded-2xl border border-gold/15">
        <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-gold/10 text-gold flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
          <i data-lucide="heart" class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Seluruh donasi digunakan sepenuhnya untuk pembangunan Masjid Jami Ar-Rustendi. Invoice, bukti pembayaran material, dan laporan penggunaan dana terbuka untuk diperiksa. Semoga menjadi amal jariyah bagi seluruh donatur. Aamiin.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>